  "_how": "A filter is GPL-gated two ways, and a grep for `gpl` in its deps line finds only the first. DIRECT: `<name>_filter_deps` contains the literal `gpl`. INDIRECT: its deps name an external library that is itself in EXTERNAL_LIBRARY_GPL_LIST or EXTERNAL_LIBRARY_GPLV3_LIST, so enabling the filter forces --enable-gpl transitively. Missing the indirect set is a FALSE PERMISSION \u2014 it tiers frei0r and vidstabtransform as permissive.",
